    {
      "version": "1.0.1",
      "releaseNotes": "In this update, playing against the computer has become even more exciting! You can now adjust the difficulty level across three settings, making it perfect for players of all skill levels, from beginners to advanced. Learn the basics at the Easy level, hone your strategies at the Medium level, and challenge the true master of Tic-Tac-Toe at the Hard level. Rise to the new challenges and claim victory across all levels!",
      "seenAt": "2023-10-29T22:07:09Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "releaseNotes": "In this update, our Tic-Tac-Toe game has become even more international! The addition of multilingual support now allows players from all around the world to enjoy the game more comfortably.\n\nNewly Supported Languages:\n- Ainu\n- Old English\n- Arabic\n- Catalan\n- Czech\n- Danish\n- German\n- Greek\n- English\n- Esperanto\n- Spanish\n- Finnish\n- French\n- Old French\n- Old High German\n- Hebrew\n- Hindi\n- Croatian\n- Hungarian\n- Indonesian\n- Italian\n- Japanese\n- Korean\n- Malay\n- Norwegian (Bokmål)\n- Dutch\n- Polish\n- Portuguese (Brazil)\n- Portuguese (Portugal)\n- Romanian\n- Russian\n- Slovak\n- Swedish\n- Thai\n- Turkish\n- Ukrainian\n- Vietnamese\n- Simplified Chinese\n- Traditional Chinese\n- Taiwanese Traditional Chinese\n- Hong Kong Traditional Chinese\n\nYour feedback is invaluable to us, and we strive to support more languages to deliver the joy of playing Tic-Tac-Toe to people worldwide.\n\nEnjoy playing Tic-Tac-Toe in your favorite language!",
      "seenAt": "2023-10-30T06:51:58Z"
    },
